# Features pipeline

- Polars + polars_ta; pure-Polars fallbacks when optional deps missing
- Lazy/streaming for large work: `.set_streaming(True)` in backtests
- Wilder smoothing ATR/RSI; BB std ddof=1
- New columns: add to `PUBLIC_FEATURE_FIELDS` in `bot/domain/contracts.py`
- Canonical hot path: `prepare_frame.py` + `prepare.py`; Wilder ATR/RSI; BB std ddof=1
